WEBVTT

01:31.520 --> 01:33.920
NANZHAO

01:38.600 --> 01:40.360
It's not that I didn't want to tell you,

01:40.440 --> 01:43.360
but right now, we are already
thousands of miles away from Yizhou.

01:43.440 --> 01:46.560
Even if I told you,
it would be beyond your reach.

01:46.640 --> 01:47.480
So,

01:48.120 --> 01:49.480
why invite unnecessary trouble?

01:54.920 --> 01:56.600
Where are Pin and the others?

01:57.920 --> 02:00.320
They traveled faster
and should already be there.

02:00.400 --> 02:02.160
Perhaps they've even settled in.

02:08.120 --> 02:11.640
Rest assured,
I will arrange for you to meet them.

02:14.200 --> 02:15.360
Do you know

02:15.880 --> 02:18.720
why I've had this carriage move so slowly?

02:18.800 --> 02:22.880
Because I wanted you to see
the scenery of Nanzhao.

02:25.880 --> 02:27.960
After seeing so much
of Yizhou's landscape,

02:28.800 --> 02:30.400
it's hard to hold
anything else in my heart.

02:34.160 --> 02:36.240
Have you heard of
"Wang Zhaojun Departs for the Frontier"?

02:36.320 --> 02:38.920
She married into
a land thousands of miles away.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.320
From that point on,

02:40.400 --> 02:43.600
the Xiongnu and Han became one family.

02:45.160 --> 02:47.360
Have you heard of Su Wu herding sheep?

02:48.560 --> 02:49.880
Imprisoned for 19 years,

02:49.960 --> 02:51.520
yet his loyalty never changed.

02:51.600 --> 02:55.200
I never believed there's a business deal
that can't be made.

02:55.280 --> 02:57.960
It all depends on the price.

03:36.440 --> 03:37.280
Why are you walking so fast?

03:37.360 --> 03:39.280
Do you know which room to go to?

03:39.360 --> 03:42.080
INN

03:44.520 --> 03:45.640
Go attend to her.

03:49.160 --> 03:50.240
Are the clothes ready?

03:50.320 --> 03:52.280
Yes, they're at the inn.

03:54.120 --> 03:56.000
Have someone deliver them.
Let her change into them.

03:56.840 --> 03:58.960
Your Highness, those clothes are…

03:59.040 --> 04:00.280
If she refuses,

04:00.360 --> 04:03.200
tell her that harming
the people she cares about

04:03.280 --> 04:06.080
is something I wouldn't hesitate to do.

04:08.200 --> 04:09.040
Understood.

04:45.640 --> 04:46.720
Goddess Leizu,

04:48.080 --> 04:49.520
you always protect silkworms.

04:50.520 --> 04:53.480
You will also bless
the brocade makers, right?

04:58.480 --> 05:01.280
Please watch over my family in Yizhou,

05:01.360 --> 05:02.520
keeping them safe.

05:03.680 --> 05:07.400
Help the kidnapped craftsmen
return home soon.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.640
And bless me…

05:11.960 --> 05:13.760
Am I asking for too much?

05:16.920 --> 05:19.320
Then, please prioritize protecting them.

05:20.120 --> 05:21.880
I can protect myself.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.720
In this desolate wilderness,

06:51.800 --> 06:53.480
there's nothing much to eat.

06:53.560 --> 06:55.800
So, just make do and eat this with me.

06:56.760 --> 06:57.880
When we enter the city tomorrow,

06:57.960 --> 07:00.600
I will throw you a banquet to welcome you.

07:01.200 --> 07:02.360
Come, have a seat.

07:17.840 --> 07:18.720
Beautiful.

07:58.200 --> 07:59.880
There was a beauty in the Central Plains

08:00.760 --> 08:02.240
who loved the sound of silk tearing.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.520
To make her smile,

08:05.440 --> 08:10.280
her king gathered brocade
from all over the land

08:11.080 --> 08:12.320
and let her tear it at will.

08:12.960 --> 08:15.680
From then on, they were inseparable.

08:17.720 --> 08:21.040
For the outfit you're wearing,
I had three of them made.

08:21.120 --> 08:23.760
If you really like
using it as a hand towel,

08:23.840 --> 08:26.920
I can have more made for you.

08:42.320 --> 08:44.080
Even if you have ambitions for the throne,

08:44.159 --> 08:45.800
I have no aspirations
of becoming your beauty.

08:46.400 --> 08:47.480
And…

08:48.640 --> 08:50.320
You didn't hear the whole story.

08:50.960 --> 08:52.160
That king…

08:52.680 --> 08:54.120
eventually lost his kingdom.

08:58.440 --> 08:59.840
I'm full. Excuse me.

09:11.640 --> 09:13.200
Did you add something to the food?

09:13.920 --> 09:14.960
You…

09:16.640 --> 09:17.760
No need to worry.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.520
What are you trying to do?

09:21.600 --> 09:22.800
I only hope

09:23.400 --> 09:25.040
you can sleep more comfortably.

09:54.560 --> 09:55.520
What are you afraid of?

09:58.560 --> 10:00.240
If I want someone,

10:01.480 --> 10:03.360
I'll make it perfectly clear.

10:34.960 --> 10:36.600
Welcome back, Your Highness!

10:38.720 --> 10:40.000
Your Highness.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.200
Don't disturb the princess consort.

10:58.360 --> 11:00.640
Could she be the rumored divine maiden?

11:01.320 --> 11:03.560
How could she be a divine maiden?
She's just Prince Bai's consort.

11:04.240 --> 11:05.840
How dare you gossip about His Highness?

11:06.560 --> 11:07.720
Do you have a death wish?

11:08.240 --> 11:09.600
- This servant deserves to die!
- This servant deserves to die!

11:10.200 --> 11:12.080
She's wearing
the princess consort's clothes.

11:13.440 --> 11:14.920
That's proof
of His Highness's determination.

11:17.480 --> 11:18.720
Does His Highness think

11:18.800 --> 11:21.440
that declaring her
as the Prince Bai's consort first

11:21.520 --> 11:23.400
will stop the king
from taking her as his wife?

11:24.920 --> 11:28.800
Throughout history,
if an emperor truly desires a woman,

11:29.560 --> 11:31.440
even if she takes holy orders,

11:31.520 --> 11:33.200
marriage and childbirth won't stop him.

11:35.680 --> 11:38.600
His Highness surely has already considered
what we can think of.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.280
Look,

11:57.480 --> 12:00.000
these flowers and plants are brought here

12:00.080 --> 12:01.760
all the way from Yizhou just for you.

12:03.120 --> 12:04.680
Seeing these plants and flowers,

12:04.760 --> 12:08.800
don't you feel closer to home?

12:11.360 --> 12:12.560
Plants have spirits.

12:14.080 --> 12:17.640
They will wither away
far from their native soil.

12:20.560 --> 12:22.080
But I believe,

12:22.680 --> 12:24.840
as long as I care for them attentively,

12:24.920 --> 12:28.920
they will adapt and take root.

12:29.000 --> 12:29.840
Don't you think?

12:47.080 --> 12:48.240
Let me tell you this.

12:49.480 --> 12:51.200
If you intend to bite
your tongue and end your life,

12:51.960 --> 12:53.000
after you die,

12:54.320 --> 12:55.960
I will make those craftsmen

12:57.040 --> 12:58.320
join you in the grave.

13:00.600 --> 13:01.600
Do you understand?

13:10.000 --> 13:11.040
You won't.

13:12.600 --> 13:16.160
You've risked everything
to rescue those craftsmen.

13:17.840 --> 13:20.280
You won't give up for anyone.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.840
Nor am I trying to end my life.

13:27.280 --> 13:29.080
I only want to tell you,

13:30.480 --> 13:32.920
the people I care about
are in your hands now.

13:33.920 --> 13:36.160
I can give in, I can compromise,

13:36.840 --> 13:38.760
but I have my limits.

13:40.120 --> 13:42.360
Please don't test me any further.

13:43.440 --> 13:44.920
Don't come any closer.

13:52.120 --> 13:55.600
Ms. Ji, you're so clever.
You must be aware of my feelings for you.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.680
You like me

14:01.920 --> 14:04.440
the way one admires a fine porcelain vase.

14:05.640 --> 14:07.760
He wants to possess it, to toy with it,

14:09.320 --> 14:11.560
but he doesn't care what it feels.

14:13.000 --> 14:15.000
He doesn't care what it wants to do

14:15.840 --> 14:17.160
or where it wants to go.

14:18.880 --> 14:21.560
This isn't affection, nor is it love.

14:22.800 --> 14:24.800
It's selfishness, possessiveness,

14:25.680 --> 14:27.080
plunder.

14:28.280 --> 14:29.120
Plunder?

14:34.720 --> 14:36.160
Shu brocade has hundreds of patterns,

14:37.560 --> 14:38.920
and love has thousands of forms.

14:41.160 --> 14:42.360
Ms. Ji,

14:45.880 --> 14:47.440
you'll get used to it.

14:58.560 --> 15:01.280
I heard you were ambushed in Yizhou.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.440
Were you seriously hurt?

15:03.520 --> 15:04.480
SHENG FENGYOU, KING OF NANZHAO

15:06.680 --> 15:08.400
Replying to Your Majesty,

15:08.480 --> 15:09.440
I'm much better now.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.480
Thank you for your concern.

15:11.560 --> 15:12.400
DU YAN

15:17.720 --> 15:19.560
You're my brother, after all.

15:20.360 --> 15:21.760
As your elder brother,

15:22.480 --> 15:24.800
I have to look out for you.

15:40.800 --> 15:43.560
Your Majesty, I am guilty.

15:45.320 --> 15:47.000
I've been pretending to be ill at home,

15:47.080 --> 15:50.440
but in truth,
I secretly traveled to Yizhou

15:51.000 --> 15:52.040
to capture craftsmen.

15:52.760 --> 15:55.480
However, I didn't expect
to be outplayed by Niu Jin,

15:56.080 --> 15:58.480
almost losing my life in Yizhou.

16:00.480 --> 16:02.000
Acting on my own initiative,

16:02.800 --> 16:04.920
I am undoubtedly guilty beyond pardon.

16:05.840 --> 16:06.920
But, Your Majesty,

16:07.760 --> 16:10.960
those craftsmen are priceless.

16:11.040 --> 16:14.680
They can make our Nanzhao brocade industry
renowned for generations.

16:20.080 --> 16:21.240
Please take a look, Your Majesty.

16:22.960 --> 16:23.840
Bring it here.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.880
Every craftsman listed in this book

16:31.480 --> 16:33.160
is the finest in Yizhou.

16:33.760 --> 16:34.600
With them here,

16:36.120 --> 16:38.760
Nanzhao will never again

16:38.840 --> 16:41.000
need to purchase brocade from Yizhou.

16:44.600 --> 16:45.440
Your Majesty,

16:46.480 --> 16:49.600
this year alone, we've purchased

16:49.680 --> 16:51.400
at least 50 bolts of brocade
monthly from Tang.

16:52.640 --> 16:57.120
If it's truly as Prince Bai claims
and this endeavor is priceless,

16:57.200 --> 16:59.720
then, in the future,
our monthly brocade production

17:00.240 --> 17:02.280
should not fall below 50 bolts.

17:08.800 --> 17:10.240
Fifty bolts?

17:13.960 --> 17:16.640
Can you accomplish that, Prince?

17:21.720 --> 17:22.880
Replying to Your Majesty,

17:23.720 --> 17:26.960
those Yizhou craftsmen are not
yet accustomed to the environment.

17:28.160 --> 17:32.000
I suggest giving them a month to recover.

17:32.600 --> 17:35.840
Starting next month,
we can make 50 bolts a month.

17:38.960 --> 17:40.240
But I've heard

17:41.160 --> 17:42.960
the chaos

17:43.800 --> 17:45.320
and uproar caused

17:45.400 --> 17:49.160
were all because Prince Bai
couldn't let go of a woman.

17:49.240 --> 17:53.360
Rumor has it she is a divine maiden
capable of blessing emperors.

17:55.160 --> 17:58.560
I initially thought Prince Bai
had gone to such great lengths,

17:58.640 --> 18:01.880
even tarnishing our Nanzhao's reputation
to bring back this divine maiden

18:01.960 --> 18:03.320
to offer her to Your Majesty

18:03.920 --> 18:05.760
for the prosperity of Nanzhao.

18:06.800 --> 18:08.680
But unexpectedly,

18:08.760 --> 18:11.320
the common folk now say this divine maiden

18:12.440 --> 18:14.640
is actually Prince Bai's consort.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.640
Prince, tell us.

18:26.360 --> 18:29.240
Is this woman a divine maiden

18:29.960 --> 18:31.640
or your consort?

18:33.240 --> 18:36.600
Your Majesty,
I've never heard of any divine maiden.

18:42.760 --> 18:43.920
Ning,

18:47.000 --> 18:48.200
you tell us.

18:48.280 --> 18:52.440
Does Prince have
a particular fondness for this woman?

19:00.560 --> 19:03.040
Replying to Your Majesty, I wouldn't know.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.840
All I know

19:06.520 --> 19:08.600
is that this woman is from Yizhou.

19:09.240 --> 19:10.800
Even if she were a divine maiden,

19:10.880 --> 19:12.480
her blessings
would only bring peace to Tang.

19:13.920 --> 19:15.680
If she stays in our Nanzhao,

19:15.760 --> 19:17.040
I'm afraid it would have
the opposite effect.

19:18.240 --> 19:20.040
Prince Bai brought her back

19:20.120 --> 19:22.800
only because
she is exceptionally talented.

19:22.880 --> 19:25.440
She alone equals hundreds of craftsmen.

19:27.880 --> 19:30.280
One woman can rival hundreds of craftsmen?

19:32.440 --> 19:36.040
Then I must meet her myself.

19:52.760 --> 19:56.120
Ji Yingying greets Your Majesty.

19:56.920 --> 19:58.640
What kind of bow is that?

20:00.280 --> 20:01.640
It is a Tang-style bow.

20:02.800 --> 20:05.840
Why perform a Tang bow here in Nanzhao?

20:07.440 --> 20:08.760
Only two types of people

20:08.840 --> 20:11.840
bow to a foreign king
in the style of their own nation,

20:12.440 --> 20:14.040
traitors and captives.

20:15.000 --> 20:17.560
I don't think, for Nanzhao's honor,

20:17.640 --> 20:20.840
anyone would refer
to our Yizhou craftsmen in such terms.

20:20.920 --> 20:21.960
Yingying,

20:22.760 --> 20:24.880
don't be rude in front of His Majesty.

20:30.640 --> 20:33.680
Prince Bai says he wants
to take you as his consort,

20:34.480 --> 20:38.640
but others say you are a divine maiden
destined to match emperors.

20:39.680 --> 20:43.280
Then tell me
what kind of person you want to be.

20:45.360 --> 20:47.320
Rumors are spreading throughout Nanzhao

20:47.400 --> 20:51.160
that I brought back a divine maiden
destined for emperors.

20:51.880 --> 20:55.120
But they don't realize
the palace will truly imprison you.

20:56.600 --> 20:57.720
If you don't want to go,

20:57.800 --> 21:00.920
you should know what you need to do.

21:03.840 --> 21:05.000
Replying to Your Majesty,

21:06.600 --> 21:07.840
I don't want either option.

21:11.280 --> 21:12.720
I want to make a deal with Your Majesty.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.400
A deal?

21:22.560 --> 21:23.560
Interesting.

21:24.120 --> 21:26.320
What kind of deal
do you want to make with me?

21:26.400 --> 21:28.200
Without brocade,

21:28.280 --> 21:29.640
even the King of Nanzhao

21:29.720 --> 21:33.280
can only use plain brocade
to embroider the sacred golden bird.

21:34.040 --> 21:35.160
But plain brocade

21:35.240 --> 21:37.640
is merely an inner garment
for our Tang concubines.

21:39.080 --> 21:40.200
How dare you!

21:40.280 --> 21:43.440
Such insolence, insulting His Majesty!

21:43.520 --> 21:45.400
- Guards!
- Let her speak.

21:52.480 --> 21:54.680
Your Majesty, please look at this first.

22:06.640 --> 22:07.640
What is this?

22:08.440 --> 22:10.720
This is Shu Red Brocade from Yizhou,

22:10.800 --> 22:12.120
woven by my father,

22:12.200 --> 22:14.840
Ji Guinan, the Brocade Master of Yizhou.

22:16.120 --> 22:19.560
Prince Bai brought countless craftsmen
and patterns from Yizhou.

22:20.160 --> 22:23.160
He merely seeks to replicate
Shu brocade patterns.

22:23.800 --> 22:26.280
But even if Shu brocade
is dyed and woven in Nanzhao,

22:26.360 --> 22:28.560
it will still be Shu brocade.

22:29.160 --> 22:32.600
Doesn't Your Majesty
wish for Nanzhao to have its own brocade?

22:33.680 --> 22:35.560
A brocade named after
Your Majesty's kingdom,

22:36.400 --> 22:39.160
renowned for generations
as the Nanzhao Brocade.

22:39.240 --> 22:40.640
Nanzhao Brocade?

22:41.240 --> 22:42.240
Are you capable?

22:43.840 --> 22:45.800
Yes, I am.

22:47.240 --> 22:49.080
I recreated my father's Shu Red Silk.

22:49.680 --> 22:51.720
I dyed a new shade, Flushed Rose.

22:51.800 --> 22:54.960
I worked with brocade households
to create a new pattern,

22:55.040 --> 22:56.000
Rippling Grain Brocade.

22:57.240 --> 22:58.760
I revolutionized brocade regulations,

22:58.840 --> 23:01.320
making Yizhou's
brocade industry thrive anew.

23:02.320 --> 23:04.480
My value as an artisan

23:04.560 --> 23:06.880
far surpasses my value as a woman.

23:09.600 --> 23:12.960
With my skills,
I can create Nanzhao Brocade,

23:13.040 --> 23:15.680
ensuring Your Majesty's
everlasting legacy.

23:21.640 --> 23:23.400
Everlasting legacy…

23:28.000 --> 23:30.640
That's a tempting business proposition.

23:31.880 --> 23:32.760
It is,

23:34.240 --> 23:36.960
because I have a significant request
for Your Majesty.

23:39.240 --> 23:41.560
When Nanzhao Brocade is completed,

23:41.640 --> 23:44.560
I hope Your Majesty will allow
the craftsmen of Yizhou to return home.

23:48.160 --> 23:49.480
But…

23:49.560 --> 23:52.880
It was Prince Bai who invited you
here as guests.

23:53.400 --> 23:57.080
How could I send you away so lightly?

23:59.040 --> 24:00.440
In our Tang,

24:01.280 --> 24:02.800
the emperor is the Son of Heaven.

24:02.880 --> 24:05.680
His word is law,
and no one dares defy him.

24:06.600 --> 24:09.080
Is it the same in Nanzhao?

24:12.400 --> 24:14.880
In Nanzhao, is that how it is?

24:19.680 --> 24:22.160
In our Nanzhao,
naturally, the king's word is law.

24:24.240 --> 24:25.080
However,

24:25.160 --> 24:28.240
I've heard that developing a new brocade

24:28.320 --> 24:29.840
takes a long time.

24:29.920 --> 24:32.200
If it takes ten years or more,

24:32.280 --> 24:35.920
wouldn't all
of Prince Bai's efforts be wasted?

24:40.240 --> 24:42.280
Ten years or more?

24:44.440 --> 24:45.720
Didn't you say

24:45.800 --> 24:48.560
you alone could rival
hundreds of craftsmen?

24:48.640 --> 24:52.840
Then I'll give you one year
to create Nanzhao Brocade.

24:56.480 --> 24:58.240
Your Majesty, a year is too short…

24:58.320 --> 25:00.160
I'm not negotiating with you.

25:08.640 --> 25:11.440
Fine. One year it is.

25:11.520 --> 25:12.920
I will create a sample of Nanzhao Brocade.

25:13.680 --> 25:15.640
We will toil day and night

25:15.720 --> 25:17.640
to meet Your Majesty's expectations.

25:18.440 --> 25:21.040
Please put it in writing, Your Majesty.

25:21.120 --> 25:24.440
Ji Yingying, don't push your luck.

25:26.640 --> 25:28.800
You don't trust me?

25:29.400 --> 25:31.240
It's not that I don't trust Your Majesty.

25:31.320 --> 25:34.240
To make a deal
with Your Majesty is an honor.

25:34.840 --> 25:37.040
But in the future,

25:37.120 --> 25:38.480
if there's no proof,

25:38.560 --> 25:40.240
others might think I'm making things up.

25:42.000 --> 25:44.000
Since Your Majesty's word is law,

25:44.080 --> 25:45.600
what harm is there
in putting it in writing?

25:46.200 --> 25:48.560
Please grant us your word, Your Majesty.

25:54.000 --> 25:55.160
Bring me a pen.

26:19.960 --> 26:24.920
NANZHAO BROCADE COMPLETE, CRAFTSMEN RETURN

26:29.520 --> 26:30.680
Thank you, Your Majesty.

26:33.000 --> 26:34.880
These Yizhou craftsmen
are numerous and diverse.

26:35.800 --> 26:38.600
You, Qingping Officer,
cannot simply stand by.

26:39.200 --> 26:42.640
Assign some people to assist Prince Bai,

26:42.720 --> 26:46.400
lest my younger brother
acts impulsively again.

26:47.840 --> 26:48.960
Understood.

26:49.040 --> 26:51.920
I will fully support Prince Bai.

26:53.240 --> 26:56.520
A year from now,
if you complete Nanzhao Brocade,

26:57.320 --> 26:59.000
I will send people to escort you back.

27:00.240 --> 27:01.680
If you fail,

27:01.760 --> 27:04.880
for every day past the deadline,
ten craftsmen will be lost.

27:06.520 --> 27:09.160
And if not a single one remains,

27:10.400 --> 27:12.440
then, regarding
the current situation in Yizhou,

27:13.080 --> 27:16.760
I will have Prince Bai
explain it personally to Tang.

27:17.800 --> 27:19.840
I will inform the Emperor of Tang

27:20.640 --> 27:22.400
that as long as peace prevails
between our two nations,

27:23.080 --> 27:25.880
the lives of envoys are of no concern.

27:51.320 --> 27:54.280
Eager to return, are you?

27:56.080 --> 27:57.920
Yes, I admit,

27:58.600 --> 28:00.440
you are a remarkably intelligent woman.

28:01.400 --> 28:03.640
But you don't understand Nanzhao,

28:03.720 --> 28:05.000
nor do you understand His Majesty.

28:05.080 --> 28:07.720
And you understand even less
the fierce struggles in the court.

28:07.800 --> 28:08.640
So what?

28:10.240 --> 28:11.720
I may understand nothing,

28:12.320 --> 28:14.440
but I know that doing this
might get us home.

28:15.000 --> 28:17.000
Even if there's only a sliver of hope,
I have to try.

28:17.080 --> 28:18.240
Even if it costs your life?

28:21.640 --> 28:24.080
Even if His Majesty keeps his word,

28:24.160 --> 28:26.720
what can you accomplish in a year?

28:26.800 --> 28:30.240
So, did you intend
to let us return after a year?

28:37.840 --> 28:40.400
If by then you refuse to enter Tang alone,

28:40.480 --> 28:42.800
please arrange for me
to meet with the craftsmen soon

28:42.880 --> 28:43.960
to start developing the new brocade.

28:49.440 --> 28:50.280
Very well.

28:51.000 --> 28:53.960
Since you're so eager
to visit the weaving camp,

28:54.840 --> 28:56.320
I'll grant your wish.

28:57.040 --> 28:58.960
I'll take you there to see for yourself.

29:13.760 --> 29:18.520
I've heard
that Prince Bai worked tirelessly

29:18.600 --> 29:21.640
and spent a fortune
to bring you from Yizhou.

29:23.440 --> 29:25.800
But Prince Bai acted in haste.

29:25.880 --> 29:28.120
Some unqualified people
have inevitably mixed in.

29:29.400 --> 29:33.400
So, I'll inspect you
on Prince Bai's behalf

29:33.480 --> 29:35.720
to see if you're worth the cost.

29:38.120 --> 29:39.600
Starting from the first row,

29:39.680 --> 29:42.160
show us your skills, one by one.

29:43.800 --> 29:46.440
We are brocade weavers, not performers.

29:46.520 --> 29:48.360
What's there to show?

29:48.440 --> 29:51.200
That's right. We won't weave. We refuse!

29:51.920 --> 29:52.760
Fine.

29:52.840 --> 29:54.640
Since the two of you refuse to weave,

29:55.440 --> 29:56.280
step forward first.

30:07.320 --> 30:10.000
Now then, anyone else unwilling to weave?

30:25.480 --> 30:28.960
This is the result of your stubbornness,
refusing to become my consort

30:29.040 --> 30:31.520
and insisting on making deals
with my elder brother.

30:32.400 --> 30:34.120
You are under my protection.

30:34.200 --> 30:38.040
Do you think Du Yan
will let you succeed in this deal?

30:38.560 --> 30:40.360
Just to undermine me,

30:40.440 --> 30:43.600
he'll do everything
he can to target you and them.

30:44.840 --> 30:46.560
You knew he would come,

30:47.400 --> 30:49.000
and you could have saved them!

30:49.080 --> 30:53.000
I could have saved them,
but I chose not to.

30:53.080 --> 30:56.800
Because you've wasted my goodwill.

30:59.080 --> 31:01.120
Don't you enjoy doing business?

31:01.200 --> 31:02.160
Fine.

31:02.240 --> 31:04.840
I'll grant your wish
and discuss business with you.

31:05.560 --> 31:07.920
The key to doing business
is making both parties happy.

31:08.000 --> 31:10.680
However, I'm not happy right now.

31:11.800 --> 31:14.240
Sheng Fengze,
I need the brocade completed,

31:14.320 --> 31:15.760
and so do you!

31:15.840 --> 31:18.280
We both want the craftsmen
to stay alive, don't we?

31:18.360 --> 31:21.240
I need craftsmen,
but I don't need all of them!

31:23.680 --> 31:26.040
I only need those
who are obedient and useful.

31:26.120 --> 31:28.680
But you, you want them to be safe.

31:29.240 --> 31:31.560
That's the biggest difference between us.

31:49.840 --> 31:51.560
So, what do you want to do now?

31:59.240 --> 32:03.240
Ms. Ji, I think
you should recognize your place.

32:05.520 --> 32:07.120
Here's a piece of advice.

32:07.960 --> 32:09.240
Your bottom line

32:10.120 --> 32:12.200
could perhaps be lowered a bit more.

32:20.000 --> 32:21.320
Let me ask again.

32:22.520 --> 32:23.800
Who else doesn't want to weave?

32:35.560 --> 32:36.640
I'm willing.

32:41.360 --> 32:42.200
Sir,

32:43.160 --> 32:44.160
it's not that they don't
want to show their skills,

32:45.600 --> 32:47.560
but their expertise

32:48.960 --> 32:52.160
requires prior steps to be effective.

32:53.120 --> 32:54.360
Please don't be angry.

32:56.680 --> 32:58.640
I am here under royal orders

32:58.720 --> 33:00.440
to assist the Prince Bai
with brocade weaving.

33:01.840 --> 33:03.800
If you perform well,

33:03.880 --> 33:05.560
His Majesty will reward you generously.

33:06.440 --> 33:08.160
But if not,

33:09.080 --> 33:10.920
Nanzhao does not feed idlers.

33:13.800 --> 33:15.640
So, he's the only one willing to weave?

33:18.360 --> 33:19.440
We are dyers.

33:20.200 --> 33:22.280
We dye silk and match colors.

33:22.880 --> 33:24.360
Dyers, you say?

33:25.800 --> 33:28.920
Come on, all dyers, come forward.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.960
Move. Move.

33:43.040 --> 33:44.200
Listen up.

33:45.400 --> 33:47.360
In Nanzhao, we don't have silkworms

33:47.440 --> 33:49.680
that can produce silk
suitable for Shu brocade.

33:51.200 --> 33:53.120
What use are you dyers to us?

33:53.200 --> 33:57.240
See, the Prince Bai indeed
brought back some useless people!

33:58.200 --> 34:00.320
- Cut them down.
- Yes, sir.

34:00.840 --> 34:02.240
No, I…

34:03.440 --> 34:04.400
Wait!

34:25.600 --> 34:27.760
The royal decree was just issued,

34:28.520 --> 34:30.800
and yet you, Qingping Officer,
have already barged in.

34:31.760 --> 34:34.159
You're certainly diligent.

34:35.840 --> 34:37.600
Prince Bai, you're over-thinking.

34:38.159 --> 34:40.520
I feared you might fail to produce brocade

34:41.159 --> 34:43.040
and face His Majesty's punishment,

34:43.800 --> 34:45.000
so I hurried over

34:45.080 --> 34:47.800
to help you deal
with these useless people.

34:50.639 --> 34:53.480
These people were brought here by me.

34:53.560 --> 34:57.240
Whether they're useful or not
should be up to me.

35:00.080 --> 35:02.480
My princess consort, what do you think?

35:03.160 --> 35:04.360
Are they useful?

35:12.880 --> 35:15.320
They are skilled craftsmen from Yizhou.

35:15.400 --> 35:17.600
If we want to weave brocade,
not a single one of them can be spared.

35:18.840 --> 35:21.200
I ask Prince Bai to show them kindness.

35:24.640 --> 35:26.040
Princess Consort?

35:28.720 --> 35:30.680
Didn't you just say

35:31.320 --> 35:33.560
that your value as an artisan

35:33.640 --> 35:36.760
far outweighs your value as a woman?

35:38.040 --> 35:39.440
How quickly you've changed.

35:46.240 --> 35:48.160
I think so too.

35:48.240 --> 35:49.920
But for people,

35:50.000 --> 35:53.200
true realization
always comes in an instant.

35:59.040 --> 36:00.160
Tell them,

36:00.240 --> 36:01.960
whose person are you?

36:05.720 --> 36:07.080
I belong to Prince Bai.

36:08.520 --> 36:09.520
Prince Bai's person?

36:11.160 --> 36:13.840
All of my subordinates belong to me.

36:14.600 --> 36:17.160
You must clearly tell the Qingping Officer

36:17.840 --> 36:20.120
that you are to become my consort.

36:31.440 --> 36:33.480
I am to become Prince Bai's consort.

36:38.800 --> 36:40.800
If the princess consort
believes they're all useful,

36:41.400 --> 36:43.080
then I believe her.

36:45.400 --> 36:46.480
Qingping Officer,

36:48.040 --> 36:49.000
what do you think?

36:50.440 --> 36:51.960
I believe,

36:52.800 --> 36:54.600
Prince Bai, your lifelong reputation

36:55.400 --> 36:58.480
has been clouded by fleeting desires.
That is unwise.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.440
If I recall correctly,

37:01.520 --> 37:05.520
His Majesty's decree
was for you to assist me,

37:05.600 --> 37:06.960
not to command me.

37:07.560 --> 37:08.960
If you've forgotten,

37:09.040 --> 37:11.840
we can go ask His Majesty together
for clarification.

37:11.920 --> 37:12.920
There's no need.

37:15.440 --> 37:18.240
I remember them very clearly.

37:18.320 --> 37:20.440
Fifty bolts of brocade per month
and the one-year agreement.

37:21.040 --> 37:23.360
Prince Bai, you carry a heavy burden.

37:24.600 --> 37:25.680
I won't disturb you further.

37:26.400 --> 37:30.160
These subordinates are left
to assist you in weaving brocade.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.800
Prince Bai, please look after us…

37:42.520 --> 37:44.120
If you wish to stay in my domain,

37:44.200 --> 37:45.280
you must abide by my rules.

37:46.360 --> 37:48.600
The first rule is,

37:48.680 --> 37:51.120
if I don't call for you,
don't speak out of turn!

37:52.000 --> 37:52.840
Understood.

37:53.400 --> 37:54.480
Now, leave!

37:59.240 --> 38:00.400
- Chi Hu.
- At your service.

38:00.480 --> 38:01.600
I leave this to you.

38:01.680 --> 38:03.880
I promised the princess consort

38:04.600 --> 38:07.240
that not a single one
of these people would be harmed.

38:07.920 --> 38:09.200
Understood.

38:10.840 --> 38:11.800
Thank you, Prince Bai.

38:18.680 --> 38:19.880
Listen up, all of you!

38:21.240 --> 38:22.440
Starting next month,

38:22.520 --> 38:24.240
produce 50 bolts of brocade per month.

38:24.920 --> 38:27.200
This is my promise to His Majesty.

38:28.000 --> 38:28.920
If it's not achieved,

38:30.040 --> 38:33.360
my blade is no slower
than the Qingping Officer's.

38:38.200 --> 38:39.760
The King of Nanzhao has agreed.

38:39.840 --> 38:41.640
If we create brocade unique to Nanzhao,

38:42.840 --> 38:44.480
he will let us return to Yizhou.

38:53.480 --> 38:54.720
It's getting late.

38:55.480 --> 38:58.040
Dear, let's head home.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.600
Could you leave Yingying here?

39:04.120 --> 39:06.640
Creating new brocade
requires collective effort.

39:07.920 --> 39:09.360
Instead of her working alone,

39:10.640 --> 39:12.000
it would be better to leave her here.

39:12.680 --> 39:13.640
Everyone working together
will yield results faster.

39:14.240 --> 39:16.720
Yes, with Yingying working alongside us,

39:16.800 --> 39:18.320
the new brocade can be achieved sooner.

39:19.320 --> 39:20.760
That's right. With Yingying here,

39:20.840 --> 39:23.200
there's hope for reaching the quota.

39:23.280 --> 39:26.600
Chi Hu will oversee things here.

39:28.280 --> 39:29.360
Let's go.

39:51.560 --> 39:52.800
Live well.

40:40.600 --> 40:42.040
Developing new brocade

40:43.040 --> 40:44.680
requires teamwork and collaboration.

40:45.680 --> 40:48.000
I can't do it alone.

40:51.480 --> 40:53.000
When you truly need them,

40:53.080 --> 40:55.200
I will let you see them.

40:56.880 --> 40:58.440
I'm not Zhao Xiuyuan.

40:58.520 --> 41:00.800
Even if I were
to cage you like a songbird,

41:00.880 --> 41:03.520
I'd provide you
with a gilded cage big enough.

41:04.200 --> 41:05.720
You could do whatever you like,

41:05.800 --> 41:08.080
except leave me.

41:09.000 --> 41:11.440
But if the brocade isn't completed,
we'll both die.

41:11.520 --> 41:15.120
So, my life is in your hands, Ms. Ji.

41:20.280 --> 41:23.040
You can take this dagger.

41:27.480 --> 41:29.400
If you want to kill me,

41:29.480 --> 41:30.760
you can use this dagger.

41:31.560 --> 41:33.640
It's sharper.

41:33.720 --> 41:35.920
It'll make my death swift,

41:36.960 --> 41:38.440
leaving no time for sorrow.

41:41.320 --> 41:43.040
Do you truly want someone

41:43.840 --> 41:45.880
who might kill you every day?

41:48.840 --> 41:50.320
I bet

41:51.720 --> 41:52.600
she won't.

41:59.440 --> 42:01.080
If you push her further,

42:02.680 --> 42:05.040
she might lose her mind
and take you down with her.

42:10.640 --> 42:12.480
I still bet she won't.

42:12.560 --> 42:14.360
Because she knows clearly

42:15.280 --> 42:16.680
that in Nanzhao,

42:16.760 --> 42:18.000
I'm the only one who believes

42:19.960 --> 42:21.640
they're valuable.

42:33.960 --> 42:35.200
Ji Yingying,

42:35.280 --> 42:36.920
my life to come

42:38.000 --> 42:39.320
will be left in your hands.
